fly-06431753`\n\n**Profile Form Test File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/profile-form.spec.ts` contains 11 comprehensive test cases for profile management, including:\n- Profile page access control (requires login)\n- Displaying current user info\n- Editing name, bio, phone, and avatar URL fields\n- Validation errors for empty name and invalid avatar URLs\n- Success message display\n- Email field shown but not editable\n- Updates persisting across navigation\n\n**Test User:** `emma@example.com` (Emma Wilson) is seeded in the database with bio, phone, and avatar URL for testing."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a849cb95308aac192 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 57211\ntool_uses: 19\nduration_ms: 89221</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"24c86dd7-4f1e-4262-a2f5-95ade9fc16a6","uuid":"460b1244-bfd8-4847-ab55-cd1ac266c63a","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Read these files and return their full contents:\n1. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md - look for the profile-form test section\n2. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/package.json - look for the test script\n3. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts\n4. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/.env - check for NEON_PROJECT_ID\n5. Find and read any profile-related components and API functions in /repo/apps/AirbnbClone (search for profile form, profile page, etc.)\n6. Find and read the seed database file for this app\n\nReturn the full contents of all files found.","agentId":"a849cb95308aac192","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the necessary information. Let me compile the full contents of all the files requested:\n\n## Summary of Files Found and Read\n\nHere are all the files you requested with their full contents:\n\n### 1. /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/package.json\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"airbnb-clone\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"vite